   <media:title>What defines a classic? | The Maserati 5000 GT Frua​</media:title>
   <media:content url="https://www.youtube.com/v/t3pzcHaD_RY?version=3" type="application/x-shockwave-flash" width="640" height="390"/>
   <media:thumbnail url="https://i1.ytimg.com/vi/t3pzcHaD_RY/hqdefault.jpg" width="480" height="360"/>
   <media:description>A work of art that resonates in time, a story passed down generations, an object that continues to captivate the world’s attention. ​
For us, a classic represents a legacy to preserve. We created the Maserati Classiche Certification program to do just that for Maserati 20 years or older or special editions of any age.​
​
Through rigorous tests and archival documentation, each certified Maserati Classiche meets the same standards of excellence as it did the day it left the warehouse. ​
The newest certified Maserati Classiche is this stunning 5000 GT Frua, 1 of only 34 of what is considered one of the most exclusive Trident creations ever made.​
#Maserati</media:description>
