  <media:group>
   <media:title>Maserati Trident Stars: 100 stars for 100 years of the Trident.</media:title>
   <media:content url="https://www.youtube.com/v/WLYKLJISb-I?version=3" type="application/x-shockwave-flash" width="640" height="390"/>
   <media:thumbnail url="https://i4.ytimg.com/vi/WLYKLJISb-I/hqdefault.jpg" width="480" height="360"/>
   <media:description>Have you looked up lately? On the centenary of our iconic logo, Maserati introduces Trident Stars, the sky's newest constellation.​
Developed with researchers at INAF – Astronomical Observatory of Padua and positioned between Leo and Boötes, 100 stars trace the iconic outline of the Trident. Each one is dedicated to an audacious individual who has helped shape the story of our Brand, including loyal customers, friends of the Brand and employees alike.​
As Cristiano Fiorio, Maserati Chief Marketing Officer and General Manager of BOTTEGAFUORISERIE, reflects, Trident Stars takes our legendary logo &quot;to the place where memory becomes eternal, transforming it into a constellation destined to shine through time.
Because legends never shine alone.​
#Maserati #100YearsOfTheTrident</media:description>
