   <media:content url="https://www.youtube.com/v/xfUAVKkOwjs?version=3" type="application/x-shockwave-flash" width="640" height="390"/>
   <media:thumbnail url="https://i1.ytimg.com/vi/xfUAVKkOwjs/hqdefault.jpg" width="480" height="360"/>
   <media:description>That moment of anticipation. ​
The leadup to the unveiling of a sartorial tribute to a century on the track. The #MaseratiMCPURACielo Tributo 1926 tailor made by #MaseratiFuoriserie was presented where it was crafted, at home in Modena. ​
We’re lifting the veil, to bring you inside the historic moment when this bespoke creation debuted, on the same day the historic 1000 Miglia passed through Modena. ​
Beside the Tributo 1926 was its inspiration, the first Maserati race car to wear the Trident, the Maserati Tipo 26.  ​
A powerful Trident moment linking past, present and future.
#Maserati</media:description>
