   <media:thumbnail url="https://i4.ytimg.com/vi/3emnRaUdaCI/hqdefault.jpg" width="480" height="360"/>
   <media:description>The journey continues. 
In Episode 2 of The Art of Motion, artist Anna Franceschini arrives in Bologna, the home of Neptune's Trident, before continuing to our historic Modena headquarters.​
Here, she discovers the shared soul of our two worlds. The #MaseratiGrecale is her welcoming, safe space, an environment similar to the enveloping comfort of a cinema, which allows her to focus on the landscape. But it is inside the factory where inspiration truly ignites, as she witnesses a choreography of manual gestures – the sartorial, bespoke care that brings every Maserati to life. A process she recognizes as a dance, not unlike her own creation process.​
#Maserati

