   <media:thumbnail url="https://i3.ytimg.com/vi/b48O43mYzfQ/hqdefault.jpg" width="480" height="360"/>
   <media:description>Thoughtful design reveals itself in the details.
From performance to everyday usability, when at the wheel, every interaction should feel intuitive, effortless. By placing headlight controls directly within the comfort screen, Maserati makes them easier to view, easier to reach and simpler to adjust for both driver and passenger.
A small detail – and a clear expression of how elegance and functionality can work together to elevate the driving experience.
#Maserati</media:description>
