   <media:description>What happens when motion becomes a catalyst for creation? 
In The Art of Motion, a three-part series in collaboration with d la Repubblica magazine, we follow artist Anna Franceschini on an inspirational journey behind the wheel of a #MaseratiGrecale Trofeo by #MaseratiFuoriserie.​
In Episode 1, the journey begins. Leaving the studio behind, Anna embraces the drive as a moment of analog decompression – a way to create space and allow ideas to form freely. For her, the world outside the window becomes like the long take of a film, an unfolding narrative that quiets the mind and awakens the senses.​
#Maserati

In collaboration with La Repubblica’s d magazine. 
